---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-32 border-t border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
  <!-- Crisis resources strip -->
  <div class="border-b border-[color:var(--color-line)] bg-[color:var(--color-bg-2)]/40">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10 py-8">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between flex-wrap gap-4">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Wenn es jetzt schwer ist</span>
          <h4 class="font-display text-2xl mt-1">Du bist nicht allein.</h4>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/hilfe"
          class="text-sm underline underline-offset-4 decoration-[color:var(--color-clay)] text-[color:var(--color-ink)] hover:text-[color:var(--color-clay)]"
        >
          Alle Hilfsangebote →
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 text-sm md:grid-cols-3">
        <a
          href="tel:08001110111"
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--color-line)] bg-[color:var(--color-bg)]/70 backdrop-blur px-5 py-4 hover:border-[color:var(--color-clay)] transition"
        >
          <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--color-mute)">Telefonseelsorge</div>
          <div class="mt-1 font-display text-xl text-[color:var(--color-ink)] group-hover:text-[color:var(--color-clay)]">
            0800 111 0 111
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-[color:var(--color-mute)] mt-1">24 h · kostenlos · anonym</div>
        </a>
        <a
          href="tel:0221892031"
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--color-line)] bg-[color:var(--color-bg)]/70 backdrop-blur px-5 py-4 hover:border-[color:var(--color-clay)] transition"
        >
          <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--color-mute)">Hilfetelefon Essstörungen</div>
          <div class="mt-1 font-display text-xl text-[color:var(--color-ink)] group-hover:text-[color:var(--color-clay)]">
            0221 892031
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-[color:var(--color-mute)] mt-1">BZgA · vertraulich</div>
        </a>
        <a
          href="tel:112"
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--color-clay-soft)] bg-[color:var(--color-butter)]/40 px-5 py-4 hover:border-[color:var(--color-clay)] transition"
        >
          <div class="eyebrow">Akuter Notfall</div>
          <div class="mt-1 font-display text-xl text-[color:var(--color-ink)] group-hover:text-[color:var(--color-clay)]">
            Notruf 112
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-[color:var(--color-mute)] mt-1">24 h · europaweit</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Brand / navigation columns -->
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10 py-14 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[color:var(--color-clay)] text-[color:var(--color-bg)] font-display text-lg">s</span>
        <span class="font-display text-2xl">Seelenmut</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[color:var(--color-mute)] max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Bindungs- und entwicklungsorientierte Innere Arbeit als Lösungsstrategie.
        Ein Leben ohne Essstörung ist möglich.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-[color:var(--color-mute)] max-w-sm">
        Dieses Angebot ersetzt keine medizinische oder therapeutische Behandlung.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-sm">
      <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Seelenmut</div>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-[color:var(--color-mute)]">
        <li><a href="/ueber-mich" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Über mich</a></li>
        <li><a href="/angebote" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Angebote</a></li>
        <li><a href="/free-your-self" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Free Your Self</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Seelenblog</a></li>
        <li><a href="/kontakt" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Kontakt</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="text-sm">
      <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Rechtliches</div>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-[color:var(--color-mute)]">
        <li><a href="/hilfe" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Hilfe &amp; Krisen</a></li>
        <li><a href="/impressum" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Impressum</a></li>
        <li><a href="/datenschutz" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Datenschutz</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
    <div
      class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10 py-5 text-xs text-[color:var(--color-mute)] flex justify-between flex-wrap gap-2"
    >
      <span>© {year} Seelenmut · Julia</span>
      <span class="font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">Ein Schritt nach dem anderen</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
